  "contract": "POST /emails/send-ebook-to-device (ApiRouter:281) needs only an authenticated user (401 without a token; no admin gate). In this order it answers 404 'Ereader device not found' when no device has the body.deviceName, 403 when the device availability refuses the user, 404 when body.libraryItemId does not resolve, 403 when the user cannot access the library item, and 404 'Ebook file not found' when the item has no ebookFile; before any of those checks it opens no SMTP connection. On success it sends the ebook through EmailManager.sendEBookToDevice and answers 200; an SMTP failure answers 400 and never 200.",
